# SAAS Platform Admin Console (Permanent)

## Law

**Platform admin ≠ Business `OWNER` / `ADMIN`.**

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Edition | **`SAAS` only** — SELF_HOSTED routes 403 / UI hidden |
| Identity | Row in PG `platform_admins` (FK `user_id`) — not a membership role |
| Scope | Cross-Business read of **minimal** tenant metadata + suspend/unsuspend |
| Audit | Every suspend/unsuspend → `audit_events` (`platform.business.suspend` / `unsuspend`) |

## Allowed surfaces (skeleton)

- List users (id, mobile, createdAt, membership counts) — no OTP / payment secrets
- List businesses (id, name, suspended, createdAt)
- List subscriptions (businessId, plan, status, endsAt)
- List failed export jobs (id, businessId, documentId, errorCode, timestamps)
- Suspend / unsuspend Business (blocks writable entitlements)

## Security

- Guard: JWT + SAAS edition + `platform_admins` membership
- Optional `PLATFORM_ADMIN_IP_ALLOWLIST` (comma-separated IPs); empty = no IP filter (document in deploy)
- Bootstrap mobiles via `PLATFORM_ADMIN_MOBILES` (seed / boot upsert) — never commit real prod numbers
- Do not expose Mongo document bodies or media binaries in admin list APIs

## Forbidden

- Using Business `OWNER` as platform superuser
- Leaving admin routes live on `SELF_HOSTED`
- Logging secrets in audit `meta`
